# Sandbox clusters. Copy to .env.sandbox (git-ignored) on the VM and fill in.
#
# One variable per cluster. The name must match a "uriEnv" in
# config/connections.json. The database user may be read-write: the server
# only exposes read tools and refuses anything that writes.
#
# Never commit the filled-in file and never paste these values into Claude.

SANDBOX_CLUSTER0_URI=
# SANDBOX_CLUSTER1_URI=
